# Paths an autonomous pull request can't land on its own.
#
# The merge sweep (genesis serve) and genesis-merge.yml read this file from the
# default branch, never from the pull request, so a pull request can't loosen the
# list it's checked against. A bot pull request that touches any of these stays
# open with `needs:human` and a comment naming the file. Everything else about it
# can be green; a person merges it or closes it.
#
# One prefix per line. A prefix covers itself and everything beneath it.

# The evolver's charter and the hooks it runs under.
.claude/

# The guard scripts, the pre-session net, and this list.
.genesis/

# CI, the merge workflow, and every workflow's permissions.
.github/workflows/

# The merge rule, including this check.
src/genesis/automerge.py
